---
const story = 'tower at a glance, in seven steps: 1, the operator deploys one JSON config to Cloudflare; 2, each minute the prober checks the watched services from outside over http, tcp, dns and tls; 3, it records the history in D1, which only the prober touches; 4, jobs post heartbeats to /beat and alert sources post incidents to /relay/incident on the page Worker; 5, the page Worker asks the prober over RPC, handing those over, reading status and, on its own cron, checking that the prober still runs; 6, the prober mails the inbox DOWN, UP, relay firing and resolved mails and a daily digest through send_email, with the failure reason; 7, the page Worker serves visitors the page and /api/status with names and status only, never a host or a reason.';
